# 🧠 2️⃣6️⃣ The Biggest Exam Trap

Never confuse the denominator.

### Profit %

[
\boxed{\frac{Profit}{CP}\times100}
]

### Loss %

[
\boxed{\frac{Loss}{CP}\times100}
]

### Discount %

[
\boxed{\frac{Discount}{MP}\times100}
]

Different bases!

